    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40830" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισῑτ-ίζομαι</span></b> , fut.
			Att.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιοῦμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					6.15
				</span></i>
			, 
				Ion.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιεῦμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.50
				</span></i>
			:—<i>furnish oneself with food</i> or
				<i>provender</i>, Id.I.c., <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.101
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Vect.</u>
				4.48
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἐκ τῆς κώμης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.176
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκεῖθεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.94
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶχον οὐδὲν</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅτου ἂν ἐπισιτίσαιντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					50.53
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1411a9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. c.acc. rei,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἄριστον</span>
			<i>provide oneself with</i> . ., <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.95
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργύριον ἐ. εἰς τὴν πορείαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					7.1.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλεψύδραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VS</u>
					2.10.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ</span>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς
				σοφιστείαν</span>
			<i>store oneself</i> for sophistry, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.78f
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρασιτέω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				32
			</span></i>.</div>
